144
00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.109
Tim Nunamaker: Yeah, this one.

145
00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:21.039
Tim Nunamaker: And so… Basically, the idea here is you just take a standard authorization flow, but you bundle in

