00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:28.350
Tim Nunamaker: additional information that's associated with that consent token. And in…

147
00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:33.250
Tim Nunamaker: smart and open banking's cases, those would be domain-specific.

148
00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:47.770
Tim Nunamaker: sort of bundles of information about what consent is being granted, like, to which medical records or to which financial documents. In PDPP's case, it's the same idea, but it's using this more general language about data that

